Subject: [PATCH] Left dock: Main, Color, Tool order, merged wheel, compact
 rows, group dropdowns

New leftdock.js/leftdock.css (loaded after ui.js, ui.js untouched):
- panel order Main Panel, Color Panel, Tool : <name>
- chromatic wheel moved into the Color Panel
- 19 px option rows, small grey inputs, plain check marks
- right click / press and hold on Main Panel group buttons opens a
  dropdown with the labels from english.tvpaint.loc (shapes, cutting,
  selection); the chosen item becomes the cell's tool

